    "title": "Getting Started",
    "html": "<ol>\n<li>Check out our <a href=\"https://github.com/KDE/kdenlive/blob/master/dev-docs/build.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">build instructions</a> to set up your development environment</li>\n<li>Familiarize yourself with the <a href=\"https://github.com/KDE/kdenlive/blob/master/dev-docs/architecture.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">architecture</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/KDE/kdenlive/blob/master/dev-docs/coding.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coding guidelines</a></li>\n<li>If the MLT library is new to you check out <a href=\"https://github.com/KDE/kdenlive/blob/master/dev-docs/mlt-intro.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MLT Introduction</a></li>\n<li>Join our Matrix channel <code>#kdenlive-dev:kde.org</code> for developer discussions and support</li>\n</ol>",
